  "monBoss9Ult": "Eclipse Reign",
  "monBoss9UltDesc": "Shadow and light strike as one.",
  "monBoss9Lore": "Sovereign of the permanent eclipse, she rules the realm equally in shadow and stolen light.",
  "monBoss10Ult": "Sovereign's Dominion",
